#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (OneLetter), group (General)
#. +> trunk6 stable5
#: khangman.kcfg:40
#, kde-format
msgid "Check this if you do not want to discover each instance of the same letter."
msgstr "Marca esta opción se non queres que se amosen todas a veces que aparece a mesma letra."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EnableAnimations), group (General)
#. +> trunk6 stable5
#: khangman.kcfg:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Enable Animations"
msgstr "Activar as animacións"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Sound), group (General)
#. +> trunk6 stable5
#: khangman.kcfg:48
#, kde-format
msgid "If checked, sounds will be played for New Game and Win Game"
msgstr "Se marcas esta opción, reproduciranse sons cando gañes ou inicies unha partida"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Hint), group (General)
#. +> trunk6 stable5
#: khangman.kcfg:53
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If checked, hints will always been displayed. If this is not checked (default)\n"
"            hints will be displayed only per word when the user chooses to show the hint."
msgstr ""
"Se se marca, as axudas aparecen sempre. Se non se selecciona (o predeterminado)\n"
"            as axudas amósanse só para unha palabra cando o usuario escolle vela."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (resolveTime), group (General)
#. +> trunk6 stable5
#: khangman.kcfg:57
#, kde-format
msgid "This setting allows you to set in seconds how much time is available for resolving the word."
msgstr "Esta opción permite indicar en segundos durante de canto tempo se dispón para resolver a palabra."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AccentedLetters), group (Advanced)
#. +> trunk6 stable5
#: khangman.kcfg:64
#, kde-format
msgid "Type accented letters separately from normal letters"
msgstr "Escribir as letras acentuadas á parte das normais"

